+        // arrow short of the actual click target. Click still hits, but the
+        // visible cursor sits noticeably left of any right-column button.
+        // Clamp only the tip itself to visibleFrame; let the sprite bleed off
+        // the edge — correct UX for a software cursor: tip must follow the
+        // target precisely, sprite is decoration.
         let visibleFrame = screen.visibleFrame
